s\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}-\\operatorname{sin}⁡u & 0 \\\\ 0 & \\operatorname{cos}⁡v\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(-\\operatorname{sin}⁡u)\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡v-0\\cdot 0 \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{sin}⁡u\\operatorname{cos}⁡v.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, when $[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}\\pi /6 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}],$ the value of our Jacobian determinant is\n\n$$\n{\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}|}_{(\\frac{\\pi }{6},0)}=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{\\pi }{6})\\operatorname{cos}⁡(0)=-\\frac{1}{2}.\n$$" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321423 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321424 13194139534943 true] [17592186321423 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321425 13194139534943 true] [17592186321423 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321426 13194139534943 true] [17592186321423 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321427 13194139534943 true] [17592186321423 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321428 13194139534943 true] [17592186321423 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534943 true] [17592186321423 1041 "selection" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321423 1104 #edb/ref 17592186321424 13194139534943 true] [17592186321423 1110 #uuid "c64f920c-a042-57c7-a992-1102d1fd8656" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321424 1034 "-\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321424 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534943 true] [17592186321424 1111 #uuid "37673c99-bc74-5ef6-85a2-e0e90b4986b7" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321425 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321425 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534943 true] [17592186321425 1111 #uuid "20f8a967-717b-59da-aa84-f27f15ecf454" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321426 1034 "1" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321426 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534943 true] [17592186321426 1111 #uuid "e796a470-b6e9-5fc2-956b-9fb66fdcfa22" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321427 1034 "0" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321427 1103 #edb/r