lity:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{e}^{uv}(v-2{u}^{2}) & >0 \\\\ v-2{u}^{2} & >0 \\\\ v & >2{u}^{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nNotice that the equation \n\n$$\nv=2{u}^{2}\n$$\n\ndefines a parabola, and the coordinates of, say, $(0,1)$ satisfy the inequality. \n\nTherefore, the region where the transformation is (locally) orientation-preserving must be the following:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14043620/assets/613e83ce5ad6154905ec9001ece078309e396561e251e85455ff261bb4cd61a0.png)" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321458 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321459 13194139534943 true] [17592186321458 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321460 13194139534943 true] [17592186321458 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321461 13194139534943 true] [17592186321458 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321462 13194139534943 true] [17592186321458 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321463 13194139534943 true] [17592186321458 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534943 true] [17592186321458 1041 "selection" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321458 1104 #edb/ref 17592186321460 13194139534943 true] [17592186321458 1110 #uuid "b6de591a-b4f0-5e48-bec9-2bb805c1fc06" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321459 1034 "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14043620/assets/1368ee41963c1abcc320d2cd35449c08599582f37c7d68f750e137fcdcd2e57b.png" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321459 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045452 13194139534943 true] [17592186321459 1111 #uuid "f1122d3f-ff29-5cb8-8015-e8edef091955" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321460 1034 "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14043620/assets/613e83ce5ad6154905ec9001ece078309e396561e251e85455ff261bb4cd61a0.png" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321460 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045452 13194139534943 true] [17592186321460 1111 #uuid "3e4e0673-9394-5e85-b2b7-6fc5f5374903" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321461 1034 "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/refere