a}(T(Δ))≈|\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}|\\cdot {{\\text{Area}(Δ)}_{⏟}}_{\\delta A}\n$$\n\n \n\nComputing the corresponding Jacobian determinant, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)} & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{∂x}{∂u} & \\frac{∂x}{∂v} \\\\ \\frac{∂y}{∂u} & \\frac{∂y}{∂v}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}} & 2v \\\\ v & u\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{u}}\\cdot u-v\\cdot 2v \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{u}-2{v}^{2} \\\\ {\\frac{∂(x,y)}{∂(u,v)}|}_{(4,2)} & ={\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{u}-2{v}^{2}\\,|}_{u=4\\,v=2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\sqrt{4}-2(2)^{2} \\\\  & =-7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Area}(T(Δ)) & ≈|-7|\\cdot \\delta A \\\\  & =7\\,\\delta A.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321465 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321466 13194139534943 true] [17592186321465 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321467 13194139534943 true] [17592186321465 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321468 13194139534943 true] [17592186321465 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321469 13194139534943 true] [17592186321465 1000 #edb/ref 17592186321470 13194139534943 true] [17592186321465 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534943 true] [17592186321465 1041 "selection" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321465 1104 #edb/ref 17592186321469 13194139534943 true] [17592186321465 1110 #uuid "62590c22-ba9a-5dfa-ac4f-6bdb5615a80f" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321466 1034 "21\\,\\delta A" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321466 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534943 true] [17592186321466 1111 #uuid "d2c3375e-3569-5ed2-9137-30b6f4aebfdf" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321467 1034 "12\\,\\delta A" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321467 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534943 true] [17592186321467 1111 #uuid "b3298e03-11de-5d79-9dea-868e02292082" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321468 1034 "3\\,\\delta A" 13194139534943 true] [17592186321468 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534943 true] [17592186321468 1111 #uuid "11915dde-f642-54f2-b35c-ef